  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sabiendo que las rectas \\(r\\equiv x=y=z\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=1+\\mu\\\\y=3+\\mu\\\\z=-\\mu\\end{cases}\\) se cruzan, halla los puntos \\(A\\) y \\(B\\), de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) respectivamente, que están a mínima distancia.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Los puntos a distancia mínima son los extremos de la perpendicular común. \\(r\\equiv(t,t,t)\\), con \\(\\vec u=(1,1,1)\\); \\(s\\equiv(1+\\mu,\\,3+\\mu,\\,-\\mu)\\), con \\(\\vec v=(1,1,-1)\\).</p>\\[A(t,t,t),\\quad B(1+\\mu,3+\\mu,-\\mu),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}=(1+\\mu-t,\\ 3+\\mu-t,\\ -\\mu-t)\\]\\[\\begin{cases}\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\vec u=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\vec v=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}4+\\mu-3t=0\\\\4+3\\mu-t=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\mu=-1,\\ t=1\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-45,\"el\":60,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.6,-0.6,-0.6],[2.2,2.2,2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.2,2.2,2.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.4,0.6,2.4],[1.6,3.6,-0.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.6,3.6,-0.6],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,1,1],[0,2,1],\"#e11d48\",1.8,false],[\"pt\",[1,1,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,2,1],\"B\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 245' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m03ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m03ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m03ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m03ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='191.4' x2='278.0' y2='102.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='284.0' y='102.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='44.0' y1='18.0' x2='314.0' y2='113.5' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='113.5' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='170.0' y1='140.5' x2='170.0' y2='62.5' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.8'/><circle cx='170.0' cy='140.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.0' y='134.5' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='170.0' cy='62.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.0' y='56.5' font-weight='700'>B</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='35.3' y2='224.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='232.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='35.3' y2='205.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='205.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='24.0' y2='207.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='208.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,237)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,237)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(A(1,1,1)\\) y \\(B(0,2,1)\\) (distancia mínima \\(|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=\\sqrt2\\))</div></div>"
    }
   ],
