  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-junio-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=(x+3)e^{-x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,5 p.) Halla las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Determina los extremos relativos de \\(f\\) y los puntos de inflexión de su gráfica.",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\): no hay verticales. \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{x+3}{e^x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim\\frac1{e^x}=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>: \\(y=0\\) en \\(+\\infty\\). En \\(-\\infty\\): \\(f\\to-\\infty\\) y \\(\\frac{f(x)}x\\to+\\infty\\): nada.</p><div class='res'>Asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) (cuando \\(x\\to+\\infty\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=e^{-x}-(x+3)e^{-x}=-(x+2)e^{-x}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−2</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−3) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-2)\\) y decrece en \\((-2,+\\infty)\\): máximo relativo en \\(x=-2\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, \\(f(-2)=e^2\\).</p>\\[f''(x)=-e^{-x}+(x+2)e^{-x}=(x+1)e^{-x}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M51.0 40Q67.0 4 83.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(−2) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M133.0 12Q149.0 48 165.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(0) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Máximo relativo en \\((-2,e^2)\\); punto de inflexión en \\((-1,2e)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='30.6,275.0 32.7,239.2 34.7,207.7 36.8,180.0 38.9,155.8 41.0,134.8 43.1,116.6 45.1,101.0 47.2,87.6 49.3,76.3 51.4,66.8 53.4,59.0 55.5,52.6 57.6,47.6 59.7,43.7 61.8,40.9 63.8,38.9 65.9,37.8 68.0,37.4 70.1,37.6 72.2,38.3 74.2,39.5 76.3,41.0 78.4,43.0 80.5,45.2 82.5,47.6 84.6,50.3 86.7,53.1 88.8,56.0 90.9,59.1 92.9,62.2 95.0,65.4 97.1,68.6 99.2,71.8 101.2,75.0 103.3,78.2 105.4,81.3 107.5,84.4 109.6,87.5 111.6,90.5 113.7,93.5 115.8,96.3 117.9,99.2 120.0,101.9 122.0,104.6 124.1,107.2 126.2,109.7 128.3,112.1 130.3,114.4 132.4,116.7 134.5,118.9 136.6,121.0 138.7,123.0 140.7,124.9 142.8,126.8 144.9,128.6 147.0,130.3 149.1,132.0 151.1,133.5 153.2,135.1 155.3,136.5 157.4,137.9 159.4,139.2 161.5,140.5 163.6,141.7 165.7,142.8 167.8,143.9 169.8,145.0 171.9,146.0 174.0,146.9 176.1,147.8 178.2,148.7 180.2,149.5 182.3,150.3 184.4,151.0 186.5,151.7 188.5,152.4 190.6,153.0 192.7,153.6 194.8,154.2 196.9,154.7 198.9,155.3 201.0,155.7 203.1,156.2 205.2,156.6 207.3,157.1 209.3,157.5 211.4,157.8 213.5,158.2 215.6,158.5 217.6,158.8 219.7,159.1 221.8,159.4 223.9,159.7 226.0,159.9 228.0,160.2 230.1,160.4 232.2,160.6 234.3,160.8 236.4,161.0 238.4,161.2 240.5,161.4 242.6,161.5 244.7,161.7 246.7,161.8 248.8,162.0 250.9,162.1 253.0,162.2 255.1,162.3 257.1,162.5 259.2,162.6 261.3,162.7 263.4,162.7 265.5,162.8 267.5,162.9 269.6,163.0 271.7,163.1 273.8,163.1 275.8,163.2 277.9,163.3 280.0,163.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='68.4' cy='37.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.4' y='31.4'>(−2, e²)</text><circle cx='98.6' cy='70.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='104.6' y='74.9'>(−1, 2e)</text><circle cx='38.1' cy='164.2' r='3.5' fill='0'/><text x='38.1' y='158.2'></text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 164.2H294.0M128.8 204.0V8